#: review-request/review.php:279
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Hey, you've been using PublishPress Taxonomies for %s on your site. We hope "
"the plugin has been useful. Please could you quickly leave a 5-star rating "
"on WordPress.org? It really does help to keep PublishPress Taxonomies "
"growing."
msgstr ""
"안녕하세요, 당신은 사이트에서 %s에 대해 PublishPress Taxonomies를 사용하고 있습니다. 이 플러그인이 유용했기를 "
"바랍니다. WordPress.org에 5성 평가를 남겨주실 수 있나요? PublishPress Taxonomies의 성장에 정말 도움이 "
"됩니다."

#: review-request/review.php:288
msgid "1 week"
msgstr "1주일"

#: review-request/review.php:304
msgid "3 months"
msgstr "3개월"

#: review-request/review.php:369
msgid "Click here to add your rating for PublishPress Taxonomies"
msgstr "여기 클릭하여 PublishPress Taxonomies에 대한 평가를 추가하세요"

#: review-request/review.php:371
msgid "Maybe later"
msgstr "다음 기회에..."

#: review-request/review.php:373
msgid "I already did"
msgstr "벌써했어요."

